id: NormalizeParentTags
name: Normalize Parent Tags
metadata:
  description: Requires Stash 0.31.0 or newer. BACK UP YOUR DATABASE BEFORE THE FIRST
    RUN - these tasks rewrite tag assignments across the whole library and Stash has
    no undo. Two library-wide tasks that normalize tag hierarchies on your entities:
    Prune removes every tag already implied by a descendant tag on the same entity,
    and Roll Up adds every ancestor of every tag on the entity. Both run from Settings
    - Tasks - Plugin Tasks and open a dialog that lists every change first; nothing
    is written until you press Proceed. A third, read-only task browses the tag hierarchy
    itself, marking multi-parent tags, protected tags and cycles, and exports it as a
    Graphviz or Mermaid diagram. Entity types are opt-in and are all off until
    enabled in the plugin settings.
